Package: GeneExprClust
Type: Package
Title: Gene Expression Clustering and Enrichment Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gabriele", "Ghezzi", email = "ghezzigabriele080@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides functions for reading, normalizing, clustering gene expression data,
    performing gene set enrichment analysis (GSEA), and visualization. Supports multiple
    clustering algorithms (hierarchical, k-means, DBSCAN), normalization methods 
    (log2, quantile, z-score, DESeq2), and integrates with clusterProfiler for enrichment.
